The Amidah blessing for the restoration of Jerusalem is called Boneh Yerushalayim (“Builder of Jerusalem”). Here is a clear English version:

Amidah – Prayer for the Restoration of Jerusalem (Boneh Yerushalayim)

Return in mercy to Jerusalem, Your city,
and dwell within it as You have spoken.

Rebuild it soon in our days as an everlasting structure,
and establish within it the throne of David.

Blessed are You, Lord,
who builds Jerusalem.

==============================================================
Slightly expanded traditional-style translation:

Return in compassion to Jerusalem Your city,
and dwell in it as You have promised;
rebuild it soon in our days as an eternal building,
and speedily establish in it the throne of David.

Blessed are You, Lord,
Builder of Jerusalem.
